  "electron.site.docs.updates": "In the Electron app, check for updates in Settings → About. You can also download the new installer from the release page and run it. Your history and settings transfer automatically.",
  "electron.site.docs.state": "TiboTattle keeps its indexes, settings and prepared contributions in a private application-data folder for your Windows account. A normal uninstall keeps your local data and Windows Credential Manager entries. To remove local data too, use Erase local data in the app before uninstalling.",
